hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"21033","Bahz narrated to us, Sulayman ibn al-Mughirah narrated to us, Humayd ibn Hilal narrated to us, he said: Abu Rifah said: I came to the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) while he was preaching, and I said: O Messenger of Allah, a strange man has come asking about his religion, he does not know what his religion is. He said: then he turned to me, and a chair was brought, and he sat on it, and began teaching me from what Allah, exalted is He, taught him. He said: then he returned to his sermon and completed its end."
